## Isolation - CRITIQUE

### Identifiants
```
PROJECT_ID={{PROJECT_ID}}
PROJECT_NAME={{PROJECT_NAME}}
CLIENT={{CLIENT_NAME}}
```

### AWS Tagging OBLIGATOIRE (NON-NÉGOCIABLE)

**⚠️ TOUTE ressource AWS sans ces tags est NON-CONFORME.**

```hcl
# Dans terraform.tfvars
project_name = "{{PROJECT_NAME}}"
client_name  = "{{CLIENT_NAME}}"

# Tags appliqués automatiquement via provider default_tags
tags = {
  Project            = "{{PROJECT_NAME}}"
  Environment        = var.environment
  Owner              = "thomas"
  CostCenter         = "{{CLIENT_NAME}}"
  ManagedBy          = "terraform"
  CreatedBy          = "la-forge"
  DataClassification = "internal"
}
```

### Isolation S3
```
s3://company-data-lake-{env}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/
├── raw/
├── processed/
└── curated/
```

### Isolation Glue Catalog
```sql
-- Database dédiée par projet
CREATE DATABASE {{PROJECT_NAME}}_${environment};
```

### Nommage AWS Resources
```
{{PROJECT_NAME}}-{environment}-{resource_type}-{identifier}

Exemples:
  {{PROJECT_NAME}}-prod-lambda-processor
  {{PROJECT_NAME}}-dev-glue-etl-events
  {{PROJECT_NAME}}-staging-s3-data-lake
```

### Dépendances Isolées
- **Virtual env**: `.venv/` dans le projet uniquement
- **Lambda layers**: Versions spécifiques au projet
- **Glue**: Jobs avec leur propre config

